# Migration revisions live in this directory, one file per revision.
#
# These files are applied in the order defined by each revision's
# ``down_revision`` pointer, not alphabetically, though the file naming
# template prefixes them with a timestamp so the directory reads in roughly
# the order they were created.
#
# Keep this directory in version control. The revision files are the schema's
# history; losing them means losing the ability to bring an older database up
# to date.
